{"id":"wb-6-389","name":"清源文庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"清源文庙","text":"清源文庙，位于山西省清徐县的一座文庙。其大成殿是珍贵的金代遗物。\n文庙建筑群坐北朝南，分三进院落。大成殿建于金泰和三年（1203年）。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B8%85%E6%BA%90%E6%96%87%E5%BA%99","revisionId":86089034,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86089034","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":null}